  ('Boredom Is a Skill You Can Practise', 'boredom-is-a-skill-you-can-practise', 'Ten minutes of nothing a day, and what it did to my attention.', '<p>Ask anyone who has done it, and they will tell you the hardest part was the first step. What struck me most was how ordinary it all seemed from the outside, and how extraordinary it felt once I was part of it. The people involved never described what they did as remarkable; to them it was simply Tuesday.</p><p>It would be easy to make this a story about nostalgia, but that isn''t quite right. It is a story about attention — about choosing what to notice and then noticing it properly.</p><h2>Looking ahead</h2><p>I spoke to a dozen people over three weeks. Each had a different reason for being there, and each, in their own way, had stopped waiting for permission. What struck me most was how ordinary it all seemed from the outside, and how extraordinary it felt once I was part of it. The people involved never described what they did as remarkable; to them it was simply Tuesday.</p><blockquote><p>The trick is to start before you feel ready. Nobody ever feels ready.</p></blockquote><p>It would be easy to make this a story about nostalgia, but that isn''t quite right. It is a story about attention — about choosing what to notice and then noticing it properly.</p><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/byb-inline-10/1200/700" alt=""><h2>Looking ahead</h2><p>The details matter here: the smell of the place, the sound of footsteps on old floors, the way conversations drift and return. These are the things you can''t plan for and can''t fake. Whether it lasts is almost beside the point. It is here now, and that is enough.</p>', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/byb-boredom-is-a-skill-you-can-practise/1600/1000', (select id from public.categories where slug = 'ideas'), (select id from admin_user), 'magazine', 'published', false, now() - interval '20 days 8 hours'),
