  ('Slow Trains Across the North', 'slow-trains-across-the-north', 'Fourteen hours, three changes and the best window seat in Europe.', '<p>It started, as these things often do, with a small decision that turned out not to be small at all. I spoke to a dozen people over three weeks. Each had a different reason for being there, and each, in their own way, had stopped waiting for permission.</p><p>The economics don''t make sense on paper. They rarely do. And yet here it is, thriving in a way that spreadsheets can''t explain.</p><h2>Why it matters</h2><p>I spoke to a dozen people over three weeks. Each had a different reason for being there, and each, in their own way, had stopped waiting for permission. There were setbacks, of course. Plans changed, budgets ran out, the weather refused to cooperate. But every obstacle seemed to sharpen the purpose rather than blunt it.</p><blockquote><p>We''re not trying to be the biggest. We''re trying to still be here in twenty years.</p></blockquote><p>The economics don''t make sense on paper. They rarely do. And yet here it is, thriving in a way that spreadsheets can''t explain.</p><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/byb-inline-14/1200/700" alt=""><h2>The people</h2><p>The details matter here: the smell of the place, the sound of footsteps on old floors, the way conversations drift and return. These are the things you can''t plan for and can''t fake. I left later than I meant to, which is usually the sign of a good day.</p>', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/byb-slow-trains-across-the-north/1600/1000', (select id from public.categories where slug = 'travel'), (select id from admin_user), 'magazine', 'published', true, now() - interval '28 days 10 hours'),
